  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Horticulture Development in Dryland Areas Sector Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will help the Ministry of Agriculure to optimize underutilized agriculture dry land towards modern agriculture, increased farming profitability, and climate change resilience. The project is expected to contribute to COVID-19 recovery by stimulating rural economy and supporting smallholder&amp;apos;s entrepreneurship.</narrative>
  </description>
